From: AF9 <af9@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:01:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove the GCYM Large Wiremill: AF9's Large Wiremill replaces
 it (7.5.3-af9.22)

The gtceu:large_wiremill multiblock, its crafting recipe and its generated
blockstate and models go; AF9 registers a machine of the same id (a KubeJS
multiblock with a rendered wire drawing machine) that keeps the quest,
recipes and items that name it.
